  "Par récurrence : u₀ = 0 ≤ {l}, et uₙ ≤ {l} ⇒ uₙ₊₁ ≤ {l}": "By induction: u₀ = 0 ≤ {l}, and uₙ ≤ {l} ⇒ uₙ₊₁ ≤ {l}",
