  "Majorée par {l} (récurrence) : on suppose 0 ≤ u ≤ {l}, avec u = uₙ.": "Bounded above by {l} (induction): assume 0 ≤ u ≤ {l}, with u = uₙ.",
  "u₀ = 0 ≤ {l}. Hérédité : si 0 ≤ uₙ ≤ {l}, alors uₙ₊₁ = √({c} + uₙ) ≤ ?": "u₀ = 0 ≤ {l}. Inductive step: if 0 ≤ uₙ ≤ {l}, then uₙ₊₁ = √({c} + uₙ) ≤ ?",
  "Croissante : uₙ₊₁ − uₙ = √({c} + u) − u pour 0 ≤ u ≤ {l}.": "Increasing: uₙ₊₁ − uₙ = √({c} + u) − u for 0 ≤ u ≤ {l}.",
  "Comment montrer que (uₙ) est croissante ?": "How do you show that (uₙ) is increasing?",
  "Montrer que uₙ₊₁ − uₙ = √({c} + uₙ) − uₙ ≥ 0": "Show that uₙ₊₁ − uₙ = √({c} + uₙ) − uₙ ≥ 0",
  "f(x) = √({c} + x) est croissante, donc (uₙ) est croissante": "f(x) = √({c} + x) is increasing, so (uₙ) is increasing",
  "f croissante dit seulement que (uₙ) est monotone ; le sens vient du signe de u₁ − u₀ = √{c} − 0, ou de uₙ₊₁ − uₙ.": "f increasing only says that (uₙ) is monotone; the direction comes from the sign of u₁ − u₀ = √{c} − 0, or of uₙ₊₁ − uₙ.",
  "Conclusion : la limite ℓ vérifie ℓ = √({c} + ℓ) et ℓ ≥ 0.": "Conclusion: the limit ℓ satisfies ℓ = √({c} + ℓ) and ℓ ≥ 0.",
  "Soit u₀ = 0 et uₙ₊₁ = √({c} + uₙ). Montre que (uₙ) est majorée par {l} et croissante, puis calcule sa limite.": "Let u₀ = 0 and uₙ₊₁ = √({c} + uₙ). Show that (uₙ) is bounded above by {l} and increasing, then compute its limit.",
  "Récurrence : si uₙ ≤ {l}, alors √({c} + uₙ) ≤ √({c} + {l}). Puis le signe de uₙ₊₁ − uₙ.": "Induction: if uₙ ≤ {l}, then √({c} + uₙ) ≤ √({c} + {l}). Then the sign of uₙ₊₁ − uₙ.",
  "Toute suite bornée est convergente.": "Every bounded sequence converges.",
