  "Faux : aₙ₊₁ = −aₙ avec a₀ = 1 donne aₙ = (−1)ⁿ, bornée et divergente (examen MT 2014).": "False: aₙ₊₁ = −aₙ with a₀ = 1 gives aₙ = (−1)ⁿ, bounded and divergent (MT exam 2014).",
  "Toute suite décroissante converge.": "Every decreasing sequence converges.",
