  "Pour tout x₀ ∈ ℝ, la suite xₙ₊₁ = xₙ {step} converge vers x₀ {op} {v}.": "For every x₀ ∈ ℝ, the sequence xₙ₊₁ = xₙ {step} converges to x₀ {op} {v}.",
