  "Développe (λ + {b})² : λ² se simplifie, et il reste {b2}λ + ▢ > 0.": "Expand (λ + {b})²: λ² cancels, and what remains is {b2}λ + ▢ > 0.",
  "{s}, bornes exclues (|q| = 1).": "{s}, endpoints excluded (|q| = 1).",
  "Pour quels b ∈ ℝ la série {s} converge-t-elle ?": "For which b ∈ ℝ does the series {s} converge?",
  "Cauchy : ᵏ√|aₖ| = |b + 1/k| → |b|. Converge si |b| < 1, diverge si |b| > 1. En b = 1 : aₖ = (1 + 1/k)ᵏ → e ≠ 0 ; en b = −1 : |aₖ| = (1 − 1/k)ᵏ → 1/e ≠ 0 : les deux divergent. Ensemble : ]−1 ; 1[.": "Root test: ᵏ√|aₖ| = |b + 1/k| → |b|. Converges if |b| < 1, diverges if |b| > 1. At b = 1: aₖ = (1 + 1/k)ᵏ → e ≠ 0; at b = −1: |aₖ| = (1 − 1/k)ᵏ → 1/e ≠ 0: both diverge. Set: ]−1 ; 1[.",
  "Ensemble des λ ≠ −{b} pour lesquels {s} converge :": "Set of λ ≠ −{b} for which {s} converges:",
