  "Géométrique : |q| < 1 ⇔ {a2}λ² < (λ + {b})² ⇔ {lo} < λ < {hi}. Aux bornes, q = −1 et q = 1 : le terme général ne tend pas vers 0, les bornes sont exclues.": "Geometric: |q| < 1 ⇔ {a2}λ² < (λ + {b})² ⇔ {lo} < λ < {hi}. At the endpoints, q = −1 and q = 1: the general term does not tend to 0, the endpoints are excluded.",
  "Pour tout b ∈ [−1 ; 1], la série Σ (b + 1/k)ᵏ converge.": "For every b ∈ [−1 ; 1], the series Σ (b + 1/k)ᵏ converges.",
