  "Σ ({a}λ/(λ + {b}))ⁿ converge pour tout λ ∈ ]{lo} ; {hi}].": "Σ ({a}λ/(λ + {b}))ⁿ converges for every λ ∈ ]{lo} ; {hi}].",
  "Faux : en λ = {hi}, la raison vaut 1, et Σ 1 diverge. Aux bornes, |q| = 1 : il faut les étudier à part.": "False: at λ = {hi}, the ratio is 1, and Σ 1 diverges. At the endpoints, |q| = 1: they must be studied separately.",
  "La série Σ (λ/(1 − λ))ⁿ (λ ≠ 1) converge si et seulement si λ < 1/2.": "The series Σ (λ/(1 − λ))ⁿ (λ ≠ 1) converges if and only if λ < 1/2.",
  "Vrai : géométrique, |λ| < |1 − λ| ⇔ λ² < (1 − λ)² ⇔ 2λ < 1. En λ = 1/2, q = 1 : diverge.": "True: geometric, |λ| < |1 − λ| ⇔ λ² < (1 − λ)² ⇔ 2λ < 1. At λ = 1/2, q = 1: diverges.",
