  "Garde la moitié où f change de signe : si f(m) a le signe de f(a), on garde [m ; b], sinon [a ; m].": "Keep the half where f changes sign: if f(m) has the sign of f(a), keep [m ; b], otherwise [a ; m].",
  "f({m}) {s1} et f({e}) {s2} : on garde [▢ ; ▢].": "f({m}) {s1} and f({e}) {s2}: keep [▢ ; ▢].",
